MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m01_001: Say, there's something I'd like to ask you.
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m01_002: Would you mind helping me with a delicate\ndiscussion? It's with Admiral Jarcham.
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m01_003: <NCA>Ask who this admiral is.
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m01_004: <NCB>Ask why she wants your help.
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m01_005: <ACA>Well, I've never met him, so I know only what\npeople have told me about him.
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m01_006: <ACB>This meeting could involve some risk, so I'd\nappreciate any assistance you can give.
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m01_007: Admiral Jarcham is said to possess a ring once\nworn by the goddess Yu Phas.
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m01_008: And I...need him to give that ring to me.
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m01_009: If you are able to help, please join me at\nFort Galcar.
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m03_001: I have a bad feeling about how this is going to\nproceed. It would be a relief to have you there.
MID_LGV_SCXX_06_m03_002: Know that I will also have a token of appreciation\nfor you once this is over. Please, do help.